# Descriptor parity corpus: one case per line, '<file> <expect> <hint>'.
# <expect> is accept or reject; <hint> is a word the rejecting reader's
# message must name (accept cases carry '-' as a placeholder).
# Recorded verdicts are the Go reader's; the shell reader must agree.
